# Build and derived output only. Content/ IS tracked on purpose: without the levels, Input Actions,
# weapon Data Assets and the imported PH-6 mesh, a fresh clone has no runnable project. The Python
# scripts in Tools/ can regenerate all of it, but a collaborator should not have to run four scripts
# before the project opens.
